PR #12 — Vercel Analytics and Speed Insights
Branch: feat/vercel-analytics           Depends on: #11             Status: DONE
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DESCRIPTION
  Page views and real-user Core Web Vitals. Speed Insights matters more than it
  looks: the LCP < 1.2s budget is currently only checked in CI on a runner, and
  this is how we find out whether it holds on a mid-range phone on real mobile
  data — which is what most of this product's traffic will be.

